 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.13-rc32 — Professional polish
+
+- UWX opens in the dark theme by default. You can still pick light or system in Appearance.
+- The sidebar has an UnderWeb X header with the version. New Dashboard is now a small + next to it.
+- App text says UWX instead of VRCX. The welcome screen is now "Welcome to UnderWeb X".
+- Fixed: Group Intelligence, the Moderation Center and the Staff Dashboard could open blank when no group was picked. They now pick your group (an UnderWeb-registered one first) and say "Pick a group" if they can't.
+- The Overview no longer shows a second "Command Center" header under the big one. The status pill now says "RECRUITING NOT APPROVED HERE" instead of "GROUP NOT ALLOWED".
+- Group Intelligence stat boxes fit in one row.
+
 ## 0.6.12-rc31 — One app: UWX sections in the sidebar
 
 - Everything UnderWeb X does now has its own spot in the left sidebar, alongside the VRCX features, instead of being tucked into tabs inside one page:
